  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scaling-up of high impact interventions in the fight against TB - Burkina Faso (01-Jan-2024-31-Dec-2026)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Burkina Faso, Tuberculosis, Programme d&apos;Appui au D&#xe9;veloppement Sanitaire (PADS) (PADS)This program has the following goals: Contribuer &#xe0; l&#x2019;am&#xe9;lioration de l&#x2019;&#xe9;tat de sant&#xe9; de la population du Burkina Faso en r&#xe9;duisant le poids de la tuberculose d&#x2019;ici &#xe0; fin 2026./ To contribute to the improvement of the health status of the population of Burkina Faso by reducing the burden of tuberculosis by the end of 2026.. The objectives of this program are: R&#xe9;duire l&#x2019;incidence de la tuberculose de 45 en 2021 &#xe0; 36 cas/100 000 habitants en 2026 / Reduce the incidence of tuberculosis from 45 in 2021 to 36 cases/100,000 inhabitants in 2026.  Reduire le taux de mortalit&#xe9; de la tuberculose de 6,4 en 2021 &#xe0; 5,5 d&#xe9;c&#xe8;s/100 000 habitants d&#x2019;ici &#xe0; fin 2026 / Reduce the mortality rate of tuberculosis from 6.4 in 2021 to 5.5 deaths/100,000 inhabitants by the end of 2026.  Accro&#xee;tre le taux de succ&#xe8;s au traitement des patients TB pharmaco sensibles de 81,5% (cohorte 2020) &#xe0; au moins 90% (cohorte 2025) et ceux TB-r&#xe9;sistante de 75% (cohorte 2020) &#xe0; au moins 80% (cohorte 2025) / Increase the treatment success rate of drug-susceptible TB patients from 81.5% (2020 cohort) to at least 90% (2025 cohort) and drug-resistant TB from 75% (2020 cohort) to at least 80% (2025 cohort)</narrative>
  </description>
